    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know the doctor said to be consistent with food but i feel like i'm not getting enough vitamins through just my regular meals. if i just take a little bit of the supplement, like once or twice a week, wouldn't that be fine? i really want to strengthen my bones since my grandma had osteoporosis.",
